        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>准爸爸备忘录</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      border: 5px solid #288528;\n      background: #fdfbfe;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      color: #101010;\n    }\n    .main-title {\n      margin: 17px 0 16px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 40px;\n      line-height: 52px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 130px;\n      height: 42px;\n      margin: 0 auto 7px;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #ee1111;\n      font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 27px;\n      line-height: 37px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      font-style: italic;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n    .section-title::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: -1;\n      left: 5px;\n      right: 5px;\n      bottom: 4px;\n      height: 8px;\n      background: #f6bd36;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      transform: skewX(-15deg);\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #e9aa20;\n    }\n    .content {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 0 17px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 21px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n    .line { white-space: nowrap; height: 21px; }\n    .mark {\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      margin-right: 2px;\n    }\n    .num { font-weight: 900; }\n    .second-title { margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    .watermark {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 252px;\n      top: 342px;\n      width: 32px;\n      height: 32px;\n      border: 2px solid rgba(180,180,180,.10);\n      transform: rotate(45deg);\n      z-index: 0;\n    }\n    .watermark::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 7px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(180,180,180,.08);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"main-title\">准爸爸备忘录</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">孕3月</div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">1、</span>孕早期油烟味容易刺激孕吐，所以做饭准爸爸也包了吧。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">2、</span>增大的子宫开始压迫膀胱，出现尿频，总有排不净尿的感觉。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">提醒孕妈千万不要刻意不喝水或憋尿，免得造成尿路感染。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">3、</span>给孕妈准备好妊娠霜，缓解孕妈妊娠纹的增长，虽然长不长纹主要看</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">体质，但是涂了能减轻点。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">4、</span>如果孕妈肚子上长了妊娠纹，要多沟通安抚她的情绪、赞美她</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">，因为肚子上布满青紫色的纹路，会让妈妈变得很自卑或不自信。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">5、</span>本月重点产检：孕12周去医院建档(需空腹)，提前查好需要准</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">备什么材料，替孕妈做足准备，带上水和零食（重要产检事项可参</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">看我之前的笔记）</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title second-title\">孕4月</div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">1、</span>很多孕妈在孕4个半月就开始感觉到胎动，胎动是了解胎儿在</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">宫内情况的最好方法，记得提醒孕妈多关注胎动情况。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">2、</span>孕4个月开始要补充钙和铁剂，钙剂提醒孕妈睡前吃，最好</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">吃带有维D成分的钙剂，要好吸收。铁剂晚上7-8点吃，同时补充维</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">生素C，有利于铁剂的吸收。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">3、</span>孕4个月后孕吐好转，食欲好转。这时候体重增长变快，提醒</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">孕妈控制体重，少食多餐，少油少盐少糖，多吃粗粮。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">4、</span>抽空陪孕妈散步、孕期瑜伽、聊天，帮助孕妈放松心情。提醒</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">孕妈不要久坐、久躺，预防水肿。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">5、</span>外出坐车时，准爸爸可以给孕妈准备专门的孕妇安全带，这样</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">坐车如果急刹车，不会勒肚子和腿，保护孕妈和胎儿</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span><span class=\"num\">6、</span>本月重点产检：孕16周唐筛或无创，无创会更检测得精确点但</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">小贵(一般无需空腹和憋尿)</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
